---
// McDonald's Event-Driven Architecture Diagram
---

<figure class="mc-diagram" aria-labelledby="mc-caption">
  <svg
    class="mc-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="mc-title mc-desc"
  >
    <title id="mc-title">McDonald's 全球百萬級即時訂單事件驅動架構</title>
    <desc id="mc-desc">
      展示從多端點餐（App/POS/Kiosk）、AWS Serverless 訂單接收、SQS
      削峰緩衝、DynamoDB 全球表狀態機、EventBridge 事件分發到門市 KVS
      廚房系統的全鏈路架構。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="mc-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="mc-diagram__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: Omnichannel Ingress -->
    <g class="mc-diagram__card" transform="translate(20, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="mc-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">OMNICHANNEL INGRESS</text>
      <text class="mc-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">多端點餐與邊緣接入</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="70"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >Mobile App / Delivery</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 全球億級行動裝置點餐</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• UberEats / DoorDash 串接</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 155)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="70"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >Kiosk 自助點餐機</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 門市高頻觸控螢幕點餐</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58">• 本機商品型錄快取</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 235)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="70"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >POS &amp; Drive-Thru</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 櫃台收銀與得來速車道</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58">• 本地離線收銀容災</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 315)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >CloudFront &amp; API Gateway</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="38"
          >• 全球 PoP 節點 Anycast 路由</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="56"
          >• WAF 邊界防禦與 JWT 鑑權</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="74">• 請求驗證與速率限制</text>
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 2: Serverless Ingestion & Buffering -->
    <g class="mc-diagram__card" transform="translate(255, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="mc-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">SERVERLESS INGESTION</text>
      <text class="mc-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">無伺服器接收與削峰</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >AWS Lambda Ingestion</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• 毫秒級自動彈性伸縮</text>
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 訂單 Schema 結構校驗</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76">• 冪等 ID 產生與去重</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >Amazon SQS (FIFO / Std)</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 尖峰時刻流量削峰填谷</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 支援百萬級每秒訊息堆疊</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 死信佇列 (DLQ) 隔離錯誤</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >Order Processor Lambda</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 批次拉取 SQS 訂單事件</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58">• 觸發支付與庫存驗證</text>
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 3: State Machine & Event Streams -->
    <g class="mc-diagram__card" transform="translate(490, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="mc-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">STATE &amp; ROUTING</text>
      <text class="mc-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">狀態機與事件串流</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="95"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >DynamoDB Global Tables</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• 訂單核心狀態儲存</text>
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 跨區域 Active-Active 複製</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 樂觀鎖 (Version/Condition)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 185)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >DynamoDB Streams</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 捕獲所有狀態變更 (CDC)</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 順序時間序列事件日誌</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76">• 零延遲觸發下游廣播</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >EventBridge Event Bus</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 宣告式規則與內容路由</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 跨微服務領域事件分發</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 4: Store Fulfillment & Real-time Sync -->
    <g class="mc-diagram__card" transform="translate(725, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="mc-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">STORE FULFILLMENT</text>
      <text class="mc-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">門市履約與實時推播</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >Kitchen Video System (KVS)</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 廚房即時出單顯示螢幕</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 漢堡/薯條工作站動態拆單</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• WebSocket 雙向狀態反饋</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >Customer Status Display</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 門市取餐螢幕「製作中/可取餐」</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• App Push (APNs/FCM) 即時通知</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 得來速語音與指示燈聯動</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="mc-diagram__subcard mc-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="mc-diagram__header mc-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >Analytics &amp; Data Lake</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• S3 / Athena 實時財務對帳</text
        >
        <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 供應鏈物料即時消耗預警</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Connectors / Flow Lines -->
    <path
      d="M 235 155 L 255 155"
      class="mc-diagram__line"
      marker-end="url(#mc-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 470 155 L 490 155"
      class="mc-diagram__line"
      marker-end="url(#mc-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 705 155 L 725 155"
      class="mc-diagram__line"
      marker-end="url(#mc-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View -->
  <svg
    class="mc-diagram__mobile"
    viewBox="0 0 320 620"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="mc-m-title"
  >
    <title id="mc-m-title">McDonald's 事件驅動架構（手機檢視）</title>

    <g class="mc-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 10)">
      <rect width="300" height="130" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="mc-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >1. 全通路點餐與邊緣接入</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• App / Kiosk / POS / 得來速多端併發</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• CloudFront PoP Anycast 邊界路由</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• API Gateway WAF 防護與 JWT 鑑權</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• 本地 POS 離線收銀容災保護</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="mc-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 155)">
      <rect width="300" height="135" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="mc-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >2. Serverless 接收與削峰緩衝</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• Lambda 毫秒級彈性伸縮處理點餐</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• Amazon SQS 萬級訂單削峰填谷</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• 冪等鍵校驗與死信隊列 (DLQ) 隔離</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• 批次非同步觸發支付與庫存檢查</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="mc-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 305)">
      <rect width="300" height="140" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="mc-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >3. 狀態機與事件串流分發</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• DynamoDB 全球表持久化訂單狀態</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• DynamoDB Streams 實時捕獲變更</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• EventBridge 宣告式路由領域事件</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• 跨區域 Active-Active 雙活無縫切換</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="mc-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 460)">
      <rect width="300" height="145" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="mc-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >4. 門市廚房履約與即時推播</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• KVS 廚房系統即時顯示與拆單製作</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• 門市看板與行動 App 即時狀態通知</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• 得來速車道語音/指示燈自動聯動</text
      >
      <text class="mc-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• S3 / Athena 實時財務對帳與供應鏈預警</text
      >
    </g>
  </svg>

  <figcaption id="mc-caption" class="mc-diagram__caption">
    圖 1：McDonald's 全球訂單事件驅動架構 — 從 API Gateway、SQS 削峰、DynamoDB
    狀態機到門市 KVS 履約
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .mc-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .mc-diagram svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 960px;
    font-family:
      -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue",
      Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .mc-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
  }

  .mc-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .mc-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Theme variables */
  .mc-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--color-bg-subtle, #f8fafc);
    stroke: var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #0f172a;
    stroke: #1e293b;
  }

  .mc-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #64748b;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__badge {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .mc-diagram__title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #0f172a;
  }

  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__title {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .mc-diagram__subcard {
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .mc-diagram__subcard--teal {
    fill: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.3);
  }

  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__subcard--teal {
    fill: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.12);
    stroke: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.35);
  }

  .mc-diagram__subcard--blue {
    fill: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
  }

  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__subcard--blue {
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
    stroke: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
  }

  .mc-diagram__subcard--gold {
    fill: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
  }

  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__subcard--gold {
    fill: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
    stroke: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
  }

  .mc-diagram__header {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .mc-diagram__header--teal {
    fill: #0f766e;
  }
  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__header--teal {
    fill: #2dd4bf;
  }

  .mc-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }
  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  .mc-diagram__header--gold {
    fill: #b45309;
  }
  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__header--gold {
    fill: #fbbf24;
  }

  .mc-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: #475569;
  }

  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__desc {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .mc-diagram__line {
    stroke: #94a3b8;
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
  }

  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__line {
    stroke: #475569;
  }

  .mc-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  :global(.dark) .mc-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #475569;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .mc-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }
    .mc-diagram__mobile {
      display: block;
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
